rvices","industry":"Asset Management","employees":null,"city":"Kuala Lumpur","summary":"iCapital.biz Berhad is a closed-ended equity fund launched and managed by Capital Dynamics Asset Management Sdn Bhd. It invests in the public equity markets of Malaysia. The fund invests in stocks of companies operating across diversified sectors. It invests in the stocks of undervalued companies. The fund benchmarks the performance of its portfolio against the KLSE Composite index. iCapital.biz Berhad was launched on 19 October 2005, and is domiciled in Malaysia.","zh":"iCapital.biz Berhad 是一家由 Capital Dynamics Asset Management Sdn Bhd 发起并管理的封闭式股票基金，于2005年10月19日成立，注册地在马来西亚。该基金投资于马来西亚公开股票市场，以 KLSE Composite 指数为业绩基准。","lines":["马来西亚股票投资：投资马来西亚公开股票市场中多元化行业公司的股票，面向基金投资者。","价值型选股：投资被低估公司的股票，面向基金投资者。"],"lines_en":["Malaysian equity investing: invests in stocks of companies across diversified sectors in the Malaysian public equity market, for fund investors.","Value stock selection: invests in stocks of undervalued companies, for fund investors."]}}